  "description": "Tomato wedges are tossed with sliced onions and cucumbers, and marinated with a zesty vinaigrette before being presented on a bed of lettuce with a garnish of hard-cooked egg and anchovy. This is a refreshing and colorful salad to display your fresh tomatoes.",
